  "label": "Appliance Functionality Stereotype",
  "description": "The stereotype that household appliances are specialized, single-function devices is a common real-world assumption. The meme mocks this by proposing an appliance that defies this logic, implying that such a device is so absurd it’s not worth considering. This relies on the viewer’s knowledge of how appliances are typically designed and marketed.",
